Comment: 0,0:23:05.99,0:23:14.99,def2,CAST3,0,0,0,,Juzo Okita: Takayuki Sugao/nHeikuro Todou: Toshihiko Kojima/nKotetsu Serizawa: Tessho Genda/nHajime Yamanami: Masashi Ebara
Comment: 0,0:23:05.99,0:23:14.99,def2,CAST4,0,0,0,,Zorder: Hideaki Tezuka/nStarsia: Kikuko Inoue/nTeresa: Sayaka Kanda
