Comment: 0,-1:59:59.99,-1:59:59.99,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We must go forward.

Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.68,0:00:08.48,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,The infinite expanse of space...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.11,0:00:14.18,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,The universe is filled with silent light...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:21.15,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Some stars cease to exist, while other stars come to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:25.28,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.28,0:00:28.08,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,The universe is alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:29.84,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...alive...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.67,0:00:31.82,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...alive !
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.76,0:00:38.88,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,That is why it needs love.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.98,0:03:08.08,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,I feel empty...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.08,0:03:10.04,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...so empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.12,0:03:14.60,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,What was the meaning of all those lives ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.82,0:03:25.32,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,In the course of human life, is there anything so valuable that deserves such pain ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.92,0:03:30.50,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,What we need is love...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.02,0:03:38.50,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...a tremendous love that can root out all the pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.22,0:03:43.08,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,Don’t you think so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.63,0:03:46.00,def2,ZORDER,0,0,0,,...Teresa ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.14,0:03:56.59,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\i1}Everything is predetermined,\N but there’s much more to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:03:59.55,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\i1}To the soldiers of a distant planet...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.54,0:04:03.38,def2,TERESA,0,0,0,,{\i1}You too, as well as everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:15.83,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx150\fscy120\pos(324,336)}Space Battleship
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.13,0:04:15.83,yamato,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fscx347\fscy257\pos(868,926)}Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.33,0:04:15.83,Karaoke Translation op,TITLE,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx167\fscy142\pos(1504,890)}Soldiers of Love
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.18,0:04:27.98,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx130\fscy105\pos(960,1040)}Earth Defense Force Special Joint Fleet
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.71,0:04:33.12,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,All ships have warped out. \NFleet, form a deep battle formation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:37.43,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\fscx123\fscy102\pos(968,1036)}Garmillas Force Frontier Guard 38th Task Force
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.22,0:04:41.50,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,All ships, prepare for anti-ship combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.46,0:04:43.93,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Begin data link.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.93,0:04:47.43,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Radar operators, pay attention \Nto the grid display change.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.13,0:04:58.38,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(950,1034)\fscx137\fscy95}Earth-Garmillas Joint Fleet
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:19.15,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}It’s been 60 days since they\N seized the Floating Continent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.15,0:05:22.82,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Garmillas has given up on\N rescuing their base's crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.35,0:05:29.75,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Our targets are the Gatlantis fleet\N and the 8th Floating Continent base.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.52,0:05:35.24,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}The glory of recapturing the Floating \NContinent is expected of us, the Earth Fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.07,0:05:43.70,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}The Garmillas force will charge as a spearhead while we destroy the left-overs individually.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.18,0:05:46.63,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Armored assault{storm} Zoellugut Class...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.63,0:05:49.78,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Long ships are rare among the \NGarmillas fleet, and we’ve got three !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.42,0:05:51.88,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Collect every bit of data you can on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.88,0:05:55.58,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,The chance of watching its\N durability this close is like...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.83,0:05:55.58,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&\pos(982,936)}Aihara !
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.75,0:05:59.53,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Garmillas is our ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.53,0:06:02.03,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Show some respect to your allied ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.70,0:06:04.07,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Yes, Captain Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:07.71,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Begin data link with the Zoellugut class ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.40,0:06:36.02,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Gatlantis fleet has launched{dispatched} hostile units from multiple bases of the 8th Floating Continent...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.02,0:06:38.80,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\pos(966,970)}{shingeki}...forming a defense line ahead of our line of attack.{attacking path.}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.88,0:06:41.19,Karaoke Translation op,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&\3c&H000000&\fscx135\fscy103}Report from our alert observation unit. \NBeware of special types with firepower transfer...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.19,0:06:44.16,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,Joint fleet has reached the mission area.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.16,0:06:48.83,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Roger. Continue monitoring \Nthe development of our mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.83,0:06:52.27,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Vanguard unit at the front of our\N formation{ in the very front} is about to engage in combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.27,0:06:53.78,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Earth fleet, advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.72,0:06:56.48,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Our fleet has begun attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.55,0:07:19.20,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Significant damage to our forces !\N The Gatlantis main fleet is advancing !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.28,0:07:32.56,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,That ship...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.08,0:07:35.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,ID confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.38,0:07:39.44,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It’s the Yunagi, ship No. 47 \Nof the 2nd Escort Destroyer Fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.38,0:07:41.90,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Fighters launching from that carrier !{Small ships took off from a carrier.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:44.15,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Fire the top side missiles !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.33,0:08:06.48,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Four torpedoes from tubes 1 through 4 !\N Attack angle, 3 degrees !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.73,0:08:07.78,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.03,0:08:52.63,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,The enemy fleet appears to be backing off !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.63,0:08:54.68,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,They're pulling back to the Floating Continent !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.40,0:08:56.18,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Backing off ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:03.13,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,The timing of their withdrawal is unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.48,0:09:05.50,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The Garmillas fleet is pursuing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:11.95,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Open a direct channel to the Garmillas flagship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.06,0:09:12.94,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Aye, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.91,0:09:21.06,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,A huge unidentified object has \Nemerged behind the Gatlantis fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.39,0:09:22.19,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.68,0:09:31.58,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,W...what the hell is that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.62,0:10:05.55,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.23,0:10:07.46,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,A super battleship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.20,0:10:36.82,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The lead Garmillas fleet has been annihilated !{’s completely destroyed.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.30,0:10:48.48,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Units 6 and 7, annihilated !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.92,0:10:50.28,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,Pull back immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.72,0:10:56.47,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Chief, this situation may be our chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.10,0:11:11.38,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,Ensure none of our ships are in the line of fire.{ is free from our ships.} \NThat’s an absolute requirement.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.07,0:11:13.04,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.90,0:11:18.63,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Inform all ships in the field to initiate Plan A !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.63,0:11:21.88,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,All ships, execute{proceed with} the plan immediately !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.51,0:11:23.50,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Plan A ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.12,0:11:25.13,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,What's that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.13,0:11:26.68,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I don’t know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.68,0:11:30.38,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,But it’s pre-set into the fleet network...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.26,0:11:34.19,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,That’s...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.48,0:11:36.43,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,...impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.62,0:11:38.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Twenty-four...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.38,0:11:39.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...twenty-three...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.38,0:11:40.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...twenty-two...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.38,0:11:41.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...twenty-one...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.38,0:11:42.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...twenty...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.38,0:11:43.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...nineteen...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.38,0:11:44.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...eighteen...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:45.16,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...seventeen...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.16,0:11:48.13,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Pull back immediately to the 3rd alert line.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.13,0:11:49.98,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,That’s the directive of Plan A.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.98,0:11:51.38,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,Never heard of it.{Don't know anything about that.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.38,0:11:52.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...ten...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.38,0:11:53.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...nine...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:54.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...eight...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.38,0:11:55.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...seven...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.38,0:11:56.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...six...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.38,0:11:57.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...five...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:11:58.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...four...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:11:59.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...three...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:00.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...two...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.38,0:12:01.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...one...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.38,0:12:01.98,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}...zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.28,0:12:07.42,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Extra-dimensional implosion detected !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.55,0:12:39.86,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,W...wave motion gun ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:41.31,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,From where ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.66,0:12:47.23,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Please promise me...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.68,0:12:54.12,def2,STARSIA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Please promise me that you will never repeat our folly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.87,0:12:56.55,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.03,0:12:58.48,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.80,0:13:05.93,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Kodai, face reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.93,0:13:09.18,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Earth was seriously damaged in the previous war.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.18,0:13:11.03,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}In order to survive...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.07,0:13:23.03,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}This is Earth Federation Defense Force Flagship Andromeda.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.68,0:13:25.63,Karaoke Translation op,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(964,860)}Earth Federation Defense Force Andromeda Class
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.68,0:13:25.63,Karaoke Translation op,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\pos(980,944)}Ship No.1 - Andromeda
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.03,0:13:25.28,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Destruction of the 8th Floating Continent is confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.78,0:13:28.88,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Proceeding to the sweep up operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.88,0:13:33.63,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Earth-Garmillas joint fleet, await further orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.63,0:13:35.98,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,You have my respect \Nfor your brave fight thus far.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.96,0:13:38.36,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.36,0:13:40.48,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,We were just a sideshow !{like a joke.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.56,0:13:46.78,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,The Andromeda...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.33,0:13:50.32,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,So it's already been completed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:02.63,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The Andromeda has entered the battle space.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:04.34,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It’s a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.83,0:14:06.99,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Dispersion wave motion gun...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.99,0:14:11.80,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,The citizens of Garmillas will change their minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.51,0:14:14.96,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,So will{do} the protesters on the Earth side.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.11,0:14:20.92,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Enemy ship detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.16,0:14:24.20,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Is it dead ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:29.63,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Defiance and Saratoga are incapable\N of continuing the mission due to damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.24,0:14:33.58,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,They're requesting permission to perform \N a long-range warp to the Earth sector.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:34.53,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Permission granted.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:36.07,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Wave motion gun...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.62,0:14:40.98,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,That was a wave motion gun, wasn’t it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.98,0:14:45.99,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Is this Earth’s answer to the past three years ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.24,0:14:55.71,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Re-ignition of the enemy ship’s propulsion detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.71,0:14:57.08,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Main guns, prepare to fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.10,0:14:59.47,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It’s accelerating rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.47,0:15:02.58,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Forget the front guns, No. 3 and 4, fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.48,0:15:06.33,def2,YAMANAMI,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.11,0:15:14.95,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Enemy Gatlantis ship,\N approaching at breakneck speed !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.95,0:15:16.58,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What ? Take evasive action !{Emergency turn !}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.26,0:15:27.32,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Are you sure ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:31.78,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Yes, the Saratoga and the Defiance warped to Earth just before the enemy ship did !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.51,0:15:35.58,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Emergency warp !\N We’re heading to Earth !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.55,0:15:49.50,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,A large mass has warped out\N in the outer rim of the Moon's orbit !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.50,0:15:50.51,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,What ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.51,0:15:54.48,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,Saratoga and Defiance’s warp-out signatures were confirmed in the same spot, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.48,0:15:58.70,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,{kyodai}...the large mass must be the Gatlantis \Nship which warped from the battle space !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.91,0:16:00.71,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Status of the combat satellites ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.71,0:16:02.38,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,They've just begun auto interception.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.46,0:16:11.47,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It broke through the combat satellites !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.54,0:16:16.86,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,Gatlantis ship has passed the Moon !\NIt’ll enter the atmosphere in 400 seconds !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.78,0:16:19.33,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Where’s the expected point of impact ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.94,0:16:21.95,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,Here !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.51,0:16:23.35,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Wha...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.03,0:16:26.38,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,This is how Gatlantis fights.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.95,0:16:37.03,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Mr. Serizawa, I’m sorry, but this is an emergency !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.03,0:16:39.79,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Please {hurry and }issue an evacuation order \Nto the entire capital immediately !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.96,0:16:46.42,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,It's no use. Once something with that much mass traveling at that speed crashes...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.42,0:16:49.43,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,I’m starting the evacuation program for civilians.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.67,0:16:52.19,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,Open the passageways to the old underground cities.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.19,0:16:54.78,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,A warp-out signature near the enemy ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.58,0:17:01.91,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,K-47, it’s the Yunagi !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.02,0:17:03.11,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.66,0:17:06.80,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Enemy ship directly above !\NIt’s on an atmospheric entry course !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.22,0:17:09.18,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire main guns ! Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.26,0:17:19.63,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,No good !\NYunagi’s main guns are just...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.63,0:17:20.74,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Cease fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.83,0:17:24.23,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Course correction !\N Come around below the enemy ship !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:32.98,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We'll push the enemy ship from below \Nto change its course ! Maximum thrust !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.43,0:17:45.08,def2,MIKAGE,0,0,0,,T...the Yunagi has made\N contact with the enemy ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.98,0:17:46.78,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.40,0:17:55.06,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,It's no use !\NThe entry trajectory hasn’t changed !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.63,0:18:06.73,def2,AIHARA,0,0,0,,Captain, Lieutenant Mori of HQ\N is hailing on the confidential line !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.73,0:18:07.53,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,From Yuki ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.53,0:18:08.78,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Connecting !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.78,0:18:11.53,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}Kodai, listen. I’m switching lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.78,0:18:13.51,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Kodai.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.18,0:18:15.10,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Sanada...?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.03,0:18:20.16,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Send me the trajectory data.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.30,0:18:27.30,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Can you really do that in \Nsuch a short period of time ?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.10,0:18:35.55,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Evacuation of the 3rd block has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.28,0:18:37.68,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Open the 7th block.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:38.78,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Moving the pallets.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.86,0:18:47.06,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We’re pulling out. Prepare for reverse thrust.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.06,0:18:47.82,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.90,0:18:50.74,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We'll put our hopes in {\i1}that{\i0} ship.{　(“her” ?)}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.26,0:19:09.68,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}All personnel in the dock area, escape to\N the ship or the evacuation block immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.68,0:19:10.68,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&}I repeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.68,0:19:16.36,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{\c&HF8F7B5&} All personnel in the dock area, escape to\N the ship or the evacuation block immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.34,0:19:19.31,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{[oi isoge]}Hey, hurry !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.75,0:19:20.50,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{[kocchi da]}This way !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:23.66,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,{[sassa to...]}Get inside now !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.88,0:19:26.98,Karaoke Translation op,SCREENTEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&H88D6E7&\3c&H4646D8&\frz351.2\pos(1048,182)}Activation
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.59,0:19:35.46,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Auxiliary engine, check complete.\NEnergy charge, 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.82,0:19:39.10,def2,YAMAZAKI,0,0,0,,Circuit, nominal. Auto-cylinder, ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.53,0:19:40.94,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Start the auxiliary engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.14,0:19:42.66,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Starting the auxiliary engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.15,0:19:44.88,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Heavy power line, contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.88,0:19:47.13,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,All energy switches on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.13,0:19:49.05,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Prepare for artillery and projectile combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.43,0:20:00.38,def2,TOKUGAWA,0,0,0,,Astro-nav rotation, 1600.\N Auxiliary engine, ignition.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.11,0:20:03.68,def2,EMOTO,0,0,0,,Releasing the gantry locks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.75,0:20:08.43,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Raise the hull.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.64,0:20:31.27,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Firing angle correction, 35 degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.96,0:20:56.12,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,Fire !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.63,0:21:13.74,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,W...we're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.64,0:21:15.68,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,R...report !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:17.43,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Y...y...yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.39,0:21:22.78,def2,WOMAN,0,0,0,,Enemy ship was destroyed\N at an altitude of 18,000 meters.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.12,0:21:33.66,def2,NANBU,0,0,0,,They got it ?{Destroyed ?}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.30,0:21:36.23,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Sanada...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.68,0:21:53.44,def2,MAN,0,0,0,,It’s the Yamato !\N The Yamato seems to have taken the shot !
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.39,0:21:57.54,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,What ? It’s supposed to \Nbe undergoing modification.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.20,0:21:59.98,def2,SERIZAWA,0,0,0,,Patch me through to the under-sea dock immediately !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.02,0:22:03.32,def2,TODOU,0,0,0,,Yamato...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.34,0:22:23.07,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,What ? What’s going on ?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.47,0:22:28.66,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,Captain Okita !
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.03,0:22:31.68,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,Kodai, get on board the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.06,0:22:36.15,def2,OKITA,0,0,0,,Get on board the Yamato.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.38,0:22:45.13,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\pos(214,870)\3c&H000000&}Episode 01
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.38,0:22:45.13,Karaoke Translation op,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\fscx118\fscy108\3c&H000000&\pos(576,1044)} AD 2202 - Resurrection of the Space Battleship Yamato
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.60,0:23:15.96,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Sono hito no yasashisa ga hana ni masaru nara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.60,0:23:15.96,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}If that person's gentleness exceeds that of the flowers
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.39,0:23:29.56,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\i1}Sono hito no utsukushisa ga hoshi ni masaru nara
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.39,0:23:29.56,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}If that person's beauty exceeds that of the stars
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.11,0:23:37.52,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kimi wa te wo hirogete mamoru ga ii
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.11,0:23:37.52,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}You had better open your arms and offer protection
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.91,0:23:44.46,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Karada wo nagedasu neuchi ga aru
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.91,0:23:44.46,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}It's worth risking your life
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.94,0:23:57.86,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Hitori hitori ga omou koto wa ai suru hito no tame dake de ii
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.94,0:23:57.86,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Each of you had better think about the person you love
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.63,0:24:12.52,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Kimi ni hanasu koto ga aru toshitara ima wa sore dake kamo shirenai
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.63,0:24:12.52,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}If there's anything I can say, perhaps that's all for now
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.52,0:24:18.98,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ima wa saraba to iwasenai de kure
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.52,0:24:18.98,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Don't make me say goodbye for now
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.22,0:24:26.60,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\i1\c&HFFFFFF&}Ima wa saraba to iwasenai de kure
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.22,0:24:26.60,def2,ENSONG,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&}Don't make me say goodbye for now.
