Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.98,0:23:19.33,Karaoke Translation op,CAST1,0,0,0,,{\3c&H000000&\a5\pos(1262,28)}Ono Daisuke\NKuwashima Houko\NOtsuka Hochu\NAkabane Kenji\NKokubun Masato\NMugihito\NTsuda Kenjiro\NNakamura Eriko\NTsuchida Dai\NSugao Takayuki\NKojima Toshihiko \NGenda Tessho\NEbara Masashi\NTezuka Hideaki\NInoue Kikuko\NKanda Sayaka\NRyumon Mutsuki\NSugai Kazuho\NFujinuma Kento\NKarasuda Hiroshi\NKikumoto Taira\NMatsumoto Sinobu
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.63,0:24:42.08,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\pos(968,658)}Preview
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.34,0:24:44.15,def2,SANADA,0,0,0,,We've been called upon...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.15,0:24:44.96,def2,KODAI,0,0,0,,We should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.11,0:24:47.22,def2,SHIMA,0,0,0,,You're not alone any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.22,0:24:50.18,def2,YUKI,0,0,0,,Kodai, I’m already happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.18,0:24:53.47,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,Meet Ambassador Barrel.\NYou’ll know the true identity of the vision.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.47,0:24:54.70,def2,KLAUS,0,0,0,,We must go forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.48,0:24:55.58,def2,TEXT,0,0,0,,{\pos(972,690)\c&HFFFFFF&}Tense Infiltration into the Embassy on the Moon
